# In the Today view the focus on the second of two tasks with the same text comes back on that one after quitting and reopening.
file <<END
Work:
	- Call Ann @due({today})
	- Call Ann @due({today}) @star
	- Write report @due({today})
END
keys gt j
restart
see 󰖙 Today
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Call Ann @due({today})
	- Call Ann @due({today}) @star @done({today})
	- Write report @due({today})
END
